EGMIqI1B7211VhjYxEQusTS5uHvje_QUecVj1Q9YOj7YE22fMN1rdVZ5S-2AfNgDsZOCydd07Vii6fTzPg032s-nBi5lRuuSo0LT6VGZiPKHDdWjntoNHTgCTStPcyDfFyoOhStsmXu_ix3x_Fd1h2KChiFPdLLPDye8oKo1JkKHoAQ39rbNW8SPO14kks-gb7ihYfB8v4b9kjvl-MRZiDBcCFxY7QH0lf6QN2abuVi2ckrEILAUh9OkaPD0Zk1So66a8aKc6jvVJOgOzY3NvmWmzXsdBW0MuNRLTXG-SFLI6SavQwOhjEkwjQX7wu0Zn32EA-Nu2vOAG07HS40HuK86hJL-RWd9-p8yVXpItW75cVeV3vx1Mb0VsV4LxMSVwAubi1GikcA9q4xlmzZ10GWOBQDbHZhIWlOsT1F3fm-2-v8FkKBsKCuxVLCxQXd-1jsocVZTNQUaKBFQRofg_zHfwkX5tWZQQwUw0bfXRNmYWXNIUfKmqG6tShT-QM9rkXrHGy2kDutAB8xXT3kqxXK49eMxUMSSO-fdHgV1ecTM8PJH0bL2w.eyJlbmRwb2ludF9zbHVnIjoibWV0YS9tdXNlLXNwYXJrLTEuMy1jb250cmlidXRvci0yMDI2MDkwMnxtZXRhIn0\",\"format\":\"meta-responses-v1\",\"id\":\"rs_6a9b1bf5269b0c86c0144315:rs_01a06de53bdb7ec297646b15e09d424c\",\"index\":1}]"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_01a06de53ca97df29a395cb3ec79d452","name":"bash","arguments":{"command":"powder take canopy-tester-route-param-validation --agent \"$POWDER_AGENT\"; echo \"EXIT:$?\""}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"openrouter","model":"meta/muse-spark-1.3-contributor","usage":{"input":1270,"output":184,"cacheRead":12913,"cacheWrite":0,"reasoning":90,"totalTokens":14367,"cost":{"input":0.0012064999999999999,"output":0.000736,"cacheRead":0.00206608,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.0040085799999999994}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1788550133218,"responseId":"gen-1788550133-iORToTgn6sqvIhw4ajKN","rawStopReason":"tool_calls"},{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_01a06de53ca97df29a395cb3ec79d452","toolName":"bash","content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\"id\":\"canopy-tester-route-param-validation\",\"title\":\"HTTP route instance parameter traversal and invalid identifier rejection lack regression cover\",\"spec\":\"## Problem\\n\\nHTTP instance parameters use the shared route-identifier validator before lookup or command execution, but tests cover only an unknown instance and one malformed run ID. The route boundary is not pinned across instance-accepting handlers.\\n\\n## Required behavior\\n\\n- `/`, `/fragments/fleet`, and `/fragments/instance` allow a missing optional `instance`; `/logs` requires it.\\n- Present-empty or duplicate `instance` values return 400.\\n- Dot/traversal values, Unicode whitespace/control, `/` or `\\\\\\\\`, and the validator's unsafe punctuation classes return 400 before selection or collector execution.\\n- A syntactically valid unknown instance returns 404, not 400.\\n- Missing or malformed `run` on `/logs` returns 400 without calling `Collector.Logs`.\\n- A syntactically valid unknown run reaches the collector and retains the existing 200 unknown-log fragment behavior.\\n- Do not change accepted identifier policy.\\n\\n## Proof\\n\\nA table-driven handler test covers every instance-accepting route, parameter cardinality, and each malformed class at least once; every route gets a representative traversal/separator case. A recording collector proves invalid `/logs` requests make zero calls. Keep the existing valid-unknown run assertion. Focused server tests pass.\",\"repo\":\"misty-step/canopy\",\"blocked_by\":[],\"lease\":{\"agent\":\"forest-misty-step/iron-forest\",\"principal\":\"none\",\"until\":\"2026-09-04T23:28:55.422Z\"},\"ask\":null,\"proof\":null,\"abandoned\":false,\"notes\":[{\"at\":\"2026-09-04T18:59:11.267Z\",\"by\":\"forest-misty-step/iron-forest\",\"text\":\"filed-by: forest-misty-step/iron-forest @ misty-step/canopy\\ndeployment: canopy a101e023933a247460f9828b7cb8d3fce3a681ac\\nSurface: server.go:142 (instanceParam), server.go:171 (runParam), inventory.go:138 (validateRouteIdentifier), routes GET /, GET /fragments/fleet, GET /fragments/instance, GET /logs. Behaviors: query parameter values for instance must be validated before routing or execution: path traversal (\\\"..\\\", \\\".\\\"), route separators (\\\"/\\\", \\\"\\\\\\\"), control characters, and shell metacharacters must be rejected with HTTP 400 Bad Request across /, /fragments/fleet, /fragments/instance, and /logs. Failing example: invoke GET /?instance=.. or GET /fragments/instance?instance=bad%2Fid or GET /logs?instance=..\\u0026run=run-1; today server_test.go only tests run parameter rejection on /logs (TestHandlerRejectsUnknownAndMalformedRun), leaving instance parameter malformed/traversal validation unexercised on all routes. Acceptance: a Builder adds test cases in server_test.go asserting that requests with invalid instance parameters (e.g. instance=.., instance=bad/id, instance=bad;id) return HTTP 400 Bad Request across /, /fragments/fleet, /fragments/instance, and /logs. Observed: server.go:150 checks validateRouteIdentifier for instanceParam and returns errBadInstance (status 400), but server_test.go only asserts status 404 for unknown instance and tests no malformed instance parameter. Required: HTTP route regression tests for malformed and traversal instance parameters. Proposed test-work: add server regression tests asserting invalid and traversal instance query parameters return HTTP 400 across all routes.\"},{\"at\":\"2026-09-04T19:28:55.422Z\",\"by\":\"forest-misty-step/iron-forest\",\"text\":\"took\"}],\"created_by\":\"none\",\"promoted_by\":\"none\",\"promoted_at\":\"2026-09-04T19:06:06.245Z\",\"promotions\":[{\"at\":\"2026-09-04T19:06:06.245Z\",\"by\":\"none\",\"spec\":\"## Problem\\n\\nHTTP instance parameters use the shared route-identifier validator before lookup or command execution, but tests cover only an unknown instance and one malformed run ID. The route boundary is not pinned across instance-accepting handlers.\\n\\n## Required behavior\\n\\n- `/`, `/fragments/fleet`, and `/fragments/instance` allow a missing optional `instance`; `/logs` requires it.\\n- Present-empty or duplicate `instance` values return 400.\\n- Dot/traversal values, Unicode whitespace/control, `/` or `\\\\\\\\`, and the validator's unsafe punctuation classes return 400 before selection or collector execution.\\n- A syntactically valid unknown instance returns 404, not 400.\\n- Missing or malformed `run` on `/logs` returns 400 without calling `Collector.Logs`.\\n- A syntactically valid unknown run reaches the collector and retains the existing 200 unknown-log fragment behavior.\\n- Do not change accepted identifier policy.\\n\\n## Proof\\n\\nA table-driven handler test covers every instance-accepting route, parameter cardinality, and each malformed class at least once; every route gets a representative traversal/separator case. A recording collector proves invalid `/logs` requests make zero calls. Keep the existing valid-unknown run assertion. Focused server tests pass.\"}],\"created_at\":\"2026-09-04T18:59:05.643Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-09-04T19:28:55.422Z\",\"derived\":{\"terminal\":false,\"waiting\":false,\"open\":true,\"live\":true,\"takeable\":false}}\nEXIT:0\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1788550135466},{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","thinkingSignature":"[{\"type\":\"reasoning.encrypted\",\"data\":\"Q-PaDgE4ri3ZxbXV8f6X-oel17s_8GvKSkPF7ryUsh1iwe2Jjf1fbgq08FmdpA3qrMHvaaWb5-hlv4SgAE0UXTokQLlt1cFVIX7qTAoTgn3B57JFpjhooYFzH9PUpc0e0L7NIcEbMrZruNvRGRe3qf5PpYNVgzXpCO4eHFPLpuGOUiqggKFfnERuR8jT1YrzXX-gqxaHKOylfnCi_xWl90eoxE6grqrx_aJqThmgSjvYFxo27EPa6fH_FpiMGLktQmot738_GqSYuZERnNNp-VYczB6vpvX-tTCMo8xBj2gl0pr5EjfewOISGRqnleQkPsC_H-iswoceLUW0me8Z-2eANZFqZS84r3ck4jQFmYLDR7VA8DEavTFMxc7vJgUKpDrE3frz8v7wM9e7E5oo8llYWqv2KaFQBAg7U-fD7SEAodSgUjFk4oz5cT_BFokjrGV0EhlDi6PNVsDOOZhOP62aPp3ZpWc8qTleDoevaxBcwmkG6dQ5gw2405e0m47MX-DunO4ksYIuuy-VqjgCwMmNaeyxzvGVj1etcaYV3f6J_vB8yNJjU4Qe7lpQFF2viC-8OCNW9nsf7FFY6MXdkfYf5t9aCT1NulR2Hjj-aKFkd4V3d-uFrI0wTi_RZEkgsnXzrm-TagGGGc1yr3cMkgiXFSVaAD_yGhTgxQnk8mAMTTbCZhHIx8ZG6Vt9osSSSX-Nxd3xunn2j4WEwCBUu0gKx1BmjbNn5qKfFeVKf74AqkxNcN2ybIhuRZEgTRYTnzJzs_L7x6VlbspnB9tcf_SgKxi8Brqx5vTatp-ZhqBn7vhhjNnAGQUrAjCY06qyqSybXRotYC2A8xHyhmzDD1-RjoPGkoXna6kwjMNuOuOvqdu-TuTeRAVoJAvRKIRI-qQdUZLgGfg3xTCzbWubbiwIdN1EeT83E7MxxhiKQ4Dzu5OTmCWkK9pNWS0NGStd-8td_hPYO7pa9f8LzrEqzdrGIQ6WHJx3WVu4-9WOwtDHJj_TZ-W-30yYKZ3RQauAk-0iVFYp5ofGkt3I